  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "C1",
      "type": "established",
      "text": "Chatbots built on large language models generate a reply autoregressively, one token at a time, each conditioned on the text so far. With streaming, tokens are sent to the app as they are generated, so the text you watch appear is being produced, not replayed.",
      "sources": [
        "S1",
        "S2",
        "S3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "C2",
      "type": "established",
      "text": "Models read and write tokens (word pieces), not words. In OpenAI's cl100k_base tokenizer (GPT-4 / GPT-3.5), 'Unbelievable' is three tokens: 'Un', 'belie', 'vable'; 'Why is the sky blue?' is six. Checked with gpt-tokenizer 2.8.1.",
      "sources": [
        "S3",
        "S4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "C3",
      "type": "established",
      "text": "At each step the model outputs a score (probability) for every token in its vocabulary. cl100k_base has about 100,000 tokens; o200k_base (GPT-4o) about 200,000.",
      "sources": [
        "S4",
        "S5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "C4",
      "type": "illustrative",
      "text": "The candidate tokens and percentages shown for the next token after 'The sky' are invented to illustrate the shape of a distribution.",
      "sources": []
    },
    {
      "id": "C5",
      "type": "established",
      "text": "By default the next token is sampled at random in proportion to its probability (temperature > 0), so the most likely token does not always win, and outputs are non-deterministic by default.",
      "sources": [
        "S5",
        "S6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "C6",
      "type": "established",
      "text": "Asking the same question twice can produce different answers, because sampling can diverge at any token and every later token depends on earlier ones.",
      "sources": [
        "S6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "C7",
      "type": "estimate",
      "text": "OpenAI's rule of thumb: 100 tokens is about 75 words in English, so 500 words is about 667 tokens, rounded to 'about seven hundred'.",
      "sources": [
        "S3"
      ]
    }
  ],
